    "summary": "2026-27: 14 clubs for the first time (182 matches from 4 September 2026). The top three qualify for the UEFA Women's Champions League (1st and 2nd straight in, 3rd through qualifying). 14th is relegated, replaced by the BWSL2 champions; 13th plays The Play-Off (29/30 May 2027) against the winner of a pre-qualifier between BWSL2's 2nd and 3rd. Teams level on points are separated by goal difference, then goals scored, then wins, then head-to-head record, then a play-off.",
